[Music]  Newell has five progression systems that  all work together every action that you  take in new world has a reward to it the  most basic form of player progression is  leveling your character every time you  level up you get points to put into your  attributes second one is weapon mastery  the way I use my weapon the better I get  with that weapon I can assign points to  give me weapon abilities the third one  is our trade skill progression whether  I'm a gatherer or an blacksmith the more  I do that thing the better at it I get  the fourth one is territory standard  just by playing in a territory you'll  gain territory standing which gives you  access to bonuses like increased  experience reduced fees and houses then  the fifth one is factions you join a  faction at some point in the game if you  want to experience the PvP side as you  do faction missions you gain faction  reputation that enables me to get better  gear and goods from the faction which is  very cool gear so there's a lot of  different ways you get to experience the  world of a term and these are just the  first ones that you'll get to taste  we really wanted to have a deep crafting  system in your world everything in the  game supports it in one way or another  as you craft in new world you become  stronger and stronger and crafting and  when it comes time to craft a sword  you're gonna start out just being happy  to get something slightly better than  the basic sword one of the things you  eventually can do is add perks to the  weapons and those different reagents  come from the different gathering skills  so expert gatherers will be a source of  these rare resources that craftsmen need  to craft these special perks on to their  items these bonuses can range from  increased damage reduced weight or even  imbuing the weapon with elemental power  there are several ingredients that you  can use that sort of push the direction  of like what perks you're gonna roll  later on perks are gonna be things like  the sword deals extra fire damage and  actually is emitting fire as you wield  it weapons can also have gem slots and  you can take gems that you find out in  the world and slot them into the weapon  to add even more additional effects  crafting weapons and armor gives you an  outlet to where if I'm not finding drops  but I do discover a recipe I can try to  craft items that really suit my play  style and are very unique between perks  gems and the crafting skill families you  have massive amounts of control over  your crafts depending on the time you  want to spend in it you can become the  best craftsman on the server  [Music]  our trade skill system features endless  progression as you create things you get  experience points that give you levels  you can level forever when you start to  pursue a crafting trade skill you'll  start as a total novice you'll begin by  crafting the most basic of things for an  armor it'll be boots for a weaponsmith  it'll be a basic iron longsword as you  improve you'll unlock more recipes and  the recipes will begin to have higher  quality outcomes in general the things  that your crafting are better than they  were before we have a lot of different  trade skills armor smithing weapons  smithing cooking and a whole bunch more  let's say you're a level 10 armor  Smither  you can make an iron breastplate which  is pretty cool if your level 40 armor  smithing you can maybe make a steel  breastplate maybe if you're a level  hundred you can make a star metal  breastplate which of course requires you  to have cooler and better ingredients  this is one of our many progression  systems inside of the world  [Music]  working on new world has been a crazy  experience  I want players to fall in love with the  art and the places that we've  established I'm really hoping to expand  the world to create new and interesting  spaces on the island that you haven't  seen with new dangers and new things to  discover  I hope people really enjoy the combat  system and I want people to experiment  with it treat your own specializations  your own playstyle  every type of player can find something  that they enjoy doing whether they want  to be a crafter or an explorer or a war  hero we think of the launch day for new  world is day one we plan to work with  and listen to the players and just keep  growing and growing the game there's so  much to do in the world but we want to  continue adding more and more we just  cannot wait to get everyone in the world  playing the game  you

